<title>USA: POINTE COUPEE PARISH, LA., WON BY A.G. EDWARDS.</title>
<headline>POINTE COUPEE PARISH, LA., WON BY A.G. EDWARDS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons said it won $6.600 million of Pointe Coupee Parish, La., road improvement bonds, Series ST-1997 A, with a net interest cost of 4.9535 percent.</p>
</text>
